# Customer master data: BP IDs, shop names, addresses.
# Never commit this to a public repo. It lives in the Google Sheet
# instead, which is access-controlled.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# config.js is intentionally NOT ignored. It holds the deployment URL,
# the app throws "সার্ভার ঠিকানা সেট করা নেই" without it, and GitHub Pages
# serves only committed files, so ignoring it ships a dead app. The GAS URL
# is public by design (deployment access is "Anyone"), so it is not a
# secret. See README for the tradeoff.

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary
tmp/
temp/